INSERT INTO "product_Products" VALUES(1,'Kimchi Fried Rice','A bold and satisfying kimchi fried rice packed with rich, savoury flavour and a spicy kick. Made with fermented kimchi, it naturally supports gut health by promoting beneficial bacteria, helping digestion while delivering comfort in every bite.','Kimchi fried rice is a bold, comforting Korean dish built on simple ingredients with deep flavour. It combines stir-fried rice with fermented kimchi, creating a balance of savoury, tangy, and slightly spicy notes. Often finished with a fried egg on top, it delivers both richness and texture in every bite.
INSERT INTO "product_Products" VALUES(2,'Salmon & Quinoa Bowl','Salmon & Quinoa Bowl is a freshly prepared seafood grain bowl built around grilled salmon, fluffy quinoa, crisp vegetables, and a light citrus finish. It balances fresh omega rich flavour, gentle seasoning, and a clean nourishing feel, giving customers a complete meal with clear ingredients, satisfying texture, and dependable everyday nutrition.','Salmon & Quinoa Bowl is designed as a complete seafood grain bowl rather than a small side or simple snack. The dish brings together grilled salmon, fluffy quinoa, crisp vegetables, and a light citrus finish, then supports them with fresh omega rich flavour, gentle seasoning, and a clean nourishing feel. Each portion is planned to feel filling without becoming heavy, with enough protein, grains, or vegetables to give the meal structure and useful energy. The flavours stay recognisable, the ingredients are easy to understand, and the presentation fits the restaurant''s warm comfort-food style. Customers can still customise the base, protein, add-ons, spice level, and portion size while keeping the original character of the product intact.',4.99,11.99,1,1,'United States','2026-06-21 00:00:00','2026-06-21 00:00:00',2,'product',100);
